{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>灣仔有私家車撞壆，司機輕傷送院，他涉嫌酒後駕駛被捕。</p><p></p><p>私家車兩邊車身損毀，安全氣袋打開，擋風玻璃碎裂。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.WC-0100.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026mzL6we88G31792628737.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>警方指昨晚十時許，涉事私家車沿夏慤道向中環方向行駛，至金鐘停車場對開撞向路中石壆，34歲男司機聲稱胸口痛，由救護員送院治理，他身上有酒氣，未能通過酒精呼氣測試，涉嫌酒後駕駛被捕。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T00:41:03.197008+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T23:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T01:38:02.008597+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T00:37:44.890942+00:00","content_hash":"8f54fdd7da137a50289ac45793426f6b69437ffe24962c51457a9f90519937c7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}